@description TotalReaper
@author Frank Acklin
@version 0.1.8
@changelog
  Add Toggle 2-Way Control — TotalMix fader/balpan moves now drive the matching REAPER track volume/pan (and direct send vol/pan) when enabled alongside the Routing Mirror. Echo-suppression keeps the loop stable.
  Add Toggle Auto-Talkback on Stop — drives /controlroom/talkback from REAPER's transport: stop/pause opens talkback, play/record closes it. Toggling on while stopped opens immediately; toggling off closes it.
  Replace single-slot snapshot save/load with one action per TotalMix snapshot slot (Save/Load TotalMix Snapshot Slot 1…8) so each slot can have its own keybinding.
  Remove Send Test Mute Input 1 (superseded by Toggle OSC Dump for sanity checking)
